# Project Structure Rules
## Purpose
Defines the **authoritative backend folder and file structure**.
This structure is designed to guarantee:
- Strict MVC enforcement
- High code reusability
- Clear ownership of responsibilities
- Predictable scalability
- Zero structural ambiguity
Any deviation from this structure is **invalid**.
---

